```
# WordPress plugin specific ignores
am-chat/*/wp-content/plugins/am-chat/
am-chat/*/

# If there are any build artifacts or temp files in the plugin directory
am-chat/*.log
am-chat/*.tmp
am-chat/*~
am-chat/.*.swp

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig

# IDE specific files in plugin directory
am-chat/.vscode/
am-chat/.idea/
am-chat/*.iml
am-chat/.project
am-chat/.settings/

# OS specific files in plugin directory
am-chat/.DS_Store
am-chat/Thumbs.db
am-chat/desktop.ini

# PHP related (if applicable to your setup)
am-chat/*.php~
am-chat/.*.php.swp

# Cache directories that might be created
am-chat/cache/
am-chat/tmp/
am-chat/temp/
```